    <string name="section_cache">Play cache</string>
    <string name="cache_desc">Every track you play (Suno stream or pCloud file) is kept on the phone and plays again without network — tunnels, no coverage. The next track is prepared while the current one plays. When the limit is reached, the tracks played longest ago make room.</string>
